==English==

===Adverb===
{{head|en|adverb|head=[[day]] [[in]], day [[out]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} Every day; [[daily]]; [[constantly]] or [[continuously]]; especially, of something that has become [[routine]] or [[monotonous]].
#: ''Even if you like peanut butter sandwiches, eating the same sandwiches '''day in, day out''' will get old.''

